SUMMARY:Walk: Cedarvale Ravine and Nordheimer Ravine with Ice Cream! 9KM
DESCRIPTION:Try New Things in Toronto!\n### **🌳 Cedarvale Ravine & Nord
 heimer Ravine Walk**\n\nCome explore two of the most historic and peaceful
  ravines in Toronto — nestled in some of the city’s most beautiful and
  wealthiest neighbourhoods.\n\nThese quiet\, tree-lined trails were once p
 opular retreats for Toronto’s elite during the turn of the century — p
 erfect for cooling off\, taking long strolls\, and even a bit of hunting b
 ack in the day!\nThis walk takes us through **Cedarvale Ravine** and **Nor
 dheimer Ravine**\, offering a glimpse into Toronto’s rich natural histor
 y — and yes\, there will be **ice cream at Dutch Dreams** to reward ours
 elves at the end!\n\n📲 **Join Our WhatsApp Group:**[ Click here to join
 ](https://chat.whatsapp.com/DRFTkxRlHS4B3IL1lMleUd)\n\n📍 Meetup Details
 :\n**🕚 Meetup Time:** 11:00 AM\n(Please arrive on time — I will only 
 wait for 5 minutes)\n**📍 Meetup Location:** Outside **Rosedale Subway S
 tation**\n🧢 Look for **Mathew in the Moose Hat!**\n\n\\*\\*\\*\n\n### *
 *$5 cash in person** or send an **E-transfer** to:\n\n📧 [mathewmaclean@
 hotmail.com](http://mathewmaclean@hotmail.com%2A%2A/)\n(*This small fee he
 lps support the group and keeps events running! Thank you!*)\n\\*\\*\\*\n*
 *🚶‍♂️ What to Expect on the Walk:**\n\n* A scenic stroll through 
 two of Toronto’s oldest and most charming ravines\n* Peaceful paths\, lu
 sh trees\, and gentle hills (note: **there will be some climbing**)\n* Gre
 at conversation\, photo ops\, and social vibes\n* A well-earned **ice crea
 m stop at Dutch Dreams**\n* The walk will end back at **Rosedale Subway St
 ation**\n\n\\*\\*\\*\n**🧳 What to Bring:**\n\n✅ Water\n✅ Comfortabl
 e walking shoes\n✅ A snack if you’d like one\n\\*\\*\\*\n\n👫 This G
 roup Is For You If:\nYou’re social\, curious\, and looking to make frien
 ds in the city — whether you're single\, partnered\, new to Toronto\, or
  just want to get out more. We also host **movies\, hikes\, arts & culture
  events\, and restaurant outings**!\n\n🚨 Friendly Reminders:\n\n* You c
 an **just show up** on the day — no pressure to commit ahead of time.\n*
  Please note: sometimes things happen and I might need to cancel last minu
 te\, so keep an eye out for updates!\n* **Leaving time:** whenever you're 
 read— stay as long or as little as you like.\n\n**Organizer:** Mathew\n\
 n📩 Contact: Post on the wall or email \\*\\*[torontomoviesandoutings@ho
 tmail.com**](http://torontomoviesandoutings@hotmail.com%2A%2A/)**Organizer
 :** Mathew\n📩 Contact: Post on the wall or email **torontomoviesandouti
 ngs@hotmail.com**
