SUMMARY:🌳🍦 ST. CLAIR WEST VILLAGE EVENING WALK\, WYCHWOOD PARK\, ICE
  CREAM & MORE!  🍦🌳
DESCRIPTION:Try New Things in Toronto!\n🌳🍦 ST. CLAIR WEST VILLAGE WA
 LK\, WYCHWOOD PARK\, ICE CREAM & MORE! 🍦🌳\n\nHidden Streets\, Storyb
 ook Homes & Some of Toronto’s Best Ice Cream\nSome parts of Toronto feel
  like you've accidentally wandered into a completely different city.\n\nJo
 in us for a relaxed social walk through St. Clair West and the hidden encl
 ave of Wychwood Park — one of Toronto's most unique and exclusive reside
 ntial communities.\n\nWychwood Park is private\, residential\, and unlike 
 anywhere else in the city. The homes are all architecturally distinct — 
 no cookie-cutter subdivisions here. Living in Wychwood Park involves a wai
 ting list\, board approval\, and community guidelines designed to preserve
  the character of the neighbourhood.\n\nIt feels almost village-like... pe
 aceful\, artistic\, and slightly secret.\nThis is not a formal historical 
 tour.\n\nIt's a social walk with beautiful surroundings\, interesting neig
 hbourhoods\, and good conversation.\n\n📲 **Join Our WhatsApp Group:**[ 
