DESCRIPTION:Try New Things in Toronto!\n# 🌆THE PATH\, CIBC SQUARE & WAT
 ERFRONT SUMMER EVENING WALK! 🌆\n\n**Escape the Heat\, Explore Toronto's
  Underground City & End the Night by the Lake**\nWhen Toronto gets hot\, t
 he smartest place to explore isn't always outside.\n\nJoin us for a summer
  evening adventure through **PATH**\, Toronto's incredible underground cit
 y — a 30-kilometre network of tunnels\, office towers\, shopping\, food 
 courts\, and hidden passageways connecting more than 70 downtown buildings
 .\nWe'll spend much of the evening enjoying the cool\, air-conditioned spa
 ces before making our way to one of Toronto's newest public spaces: **CIBC
  Square Park**\, an elevated urban park built above the railway tracks wit
 h incredible views of the city.\n\nTo finish the evening\, we'll head down
  to Toronto's beautiful waterfront where those who would like can grab a *
 *BeaverTail**\, relax by the lake\, and enjoy one of the best summer eveni
 ngs the city has to offer.\n\nThis isn't a historical tour.\n\nIt's a soci
 al walk\, an urban adventure\, and a great excuse to escape the summer hea
 t while discovering parts of downtown many people have never seen.\n\n📲
  **Join Our WhatsApp Group:**[ Click here to join](https://chat.whatsapp.c
 om/DRFTkxRlHS4B3IL1lMleUd)\n\n***\n\n## 🚶‍♂️ What We'll Do\n\nWe'
