 en south toward the PATH system.\nOnce underground we'll weave our way thr
 ough Toronto's famous underground city\, discovering hidden corridors\, of
 fice towers\, shopping areas\, and the unique network that keeps downtown 
 moving year-round.\nFrom there we'll visit **CIBC Square Park**\, Toronto'
 s beautiful new elevated park built above the rail corridor\, offering spe
 ctacular views over Union Station and the surrounding skyline.\nFinally we
 'll stroll down to the waterfront where we'll relax beside Lake Ontario.\n
 If you'd like\, we'll grab a BeaverTail and spend a little time enjoying t
 he evening before heading home.\nExpect about **2½ to 3 hours** of walkin
 g at a comfortable social pace.\n\n***\n\n## ☀️ Weather & Expectations
 \n\nThis walk happens rain or shine.\nOne of the best parts of this event 
